			"notes": {
				"rationale": "vorbei stands in the right bracket and vorbeiführen an + Dat is a dictionary particle verb in this sense, so vorbei is the separable particle and an the governed preposition, though a prepositional phrase precedes it. Out of the bracket, as in der Weg an der Kirche vorbei, an … vorbei is a circumposition."
